{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up in a closed mall and you are alone.. or maybe not?\u00a0With no way out but going down, you must descend using elevator through each floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If anything feel strange, go up using Elevator Behind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If nothing strange, go down using Elevator in the Front.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you <strong>escape</strong>, or will you become part of the <strong>Anomaly</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape: Mall</strong> is short walking simulator horror game where you must escape from closed mall while observing surroundings for Anomalies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secret to reveal the truth behind the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will available in English, Bahasa, and Japanese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 30+ Anomaly variation to uncover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Ending</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collection: See Anomaly or Ending you already unlocked if you missed it by chance</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20-60 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Option</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphic settings:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camera Shake</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle of camera shake can be turn <strong>on</strong>  for more immersive feel during gameplay or <strong>off</strong> if you feel dizzy by the movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse Sensitivity</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change how responsive movement of your mouse with movement of the camera on the game. If sensitivity is set high, camera movement on the game will move significantly faster when the mouse if moved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphics Presets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set the overall graphic settings to optimized between smooth gameplay performance and visual quality from Low to Epic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brightness</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust screen brightness to suit your environment and improve visibility in dark areas. This game is set to be dark to enhance the horror experience but you can adjust if it is too dark.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3639220?t=1757685449","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639220/6fe950980c34e4cd0d49a2a3c9964a24549c2c62/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757685449","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639220/731d6084bbfff8999ab4ea142bc9ab04ff4e7616/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757685449","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639220/731d6084bbfff8999ab4ea142bc9ab04ff4e7616/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757685